/* OVER THE BOARD: what the thirteen beings say. Written for each being, never generated.
   {piece} is the piece that was taken. A line is never said twice in one game while an unsaid one is left in its pool.

   When each kind fires (game.js):
     greet     a new game                      think    an ordinary move, mid-game
     open      its first few moves             late     the endgame (few pieces left, or past move 28)
     ahead     it is clearly winning           behind   it is clearly losing
     capture   it takes a piece                lose     you take one of its pieces
     check     it gives check                  checked  you give check
     castled   it castles                      ucastle  you castle
     promo     it promotes a pawn              upromo   you promote a pawn
     blunder   you hang material               good     you find a strong move
     win / lost / resign / taken / draw        event    its own moment (see beings.js) */

