    win: ['Mate. Oh. I won. Nobody pop it.', 'Checkmate. Softly. Very softly.', 'Mate. I floated all the way to the end. Nobody touch me.'],
    lost: ["Mate. That's all right. I'm used to deflating.", 'Checkmate. A slow hiss. I am fine. Fine.', 'Mate. Well. Down I go, gently.'],
